# Medical Disclaimer

Last updated: 2026-04-27

Bebito is for informational and personal tracking purposes only.

It is not a medical device and is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease or condition.

Growth charts shown in the app are based on the WHO Child Growth Standards as a reference.

Percentile values are estimates calculated from the data you enter and should not be interpreted as a diagnosis.

Always consult a qualified pediatrician or healthcare professional for any medical questions or decisions about your child's health.
